    "detailed_description": "Ares Breathes is a classic survival horror game in which you explore a recently destroyed Martian colony, given shape as a late 90s style low poly game complete with tank controls and static cameras. <br><br>Explore a destroyed Martian colony through hand-placed camera angles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b953cdfb05d01933f248a101c1c3b7b8.poster.avif?t=1730438295\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b953cdfb05d01933f248a101c1c3b7b8.webm?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b953cdfb05d01933f248a101c1c3b7b8.mp4?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Manage your vitals as you explore an interconnected town complete with optional shortcuts, hidden items and environmental puzzles. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/4e30727fd226421b268ae4590431af21.poster.avif?t=1730438295\" width=320 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/4e30727fd226421b268ae4590431af21.webm?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/4e30727fd226421b268ae4590431af21.mp4?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fight off enemies with smart target prioritization.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/6a13164d0606012d946a07d7dd3dd5f6.poster.avif?t=1730438295\" width=320 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/6a13164d0606012d946a07d7dd3dd5f6.webm?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/6a13164d0606012d946a07d7dd3dd5f6.mp4?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Interact with and repair the infrastructure of the colony to expand your range of exploration.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b9f9effc1c521661add1cc0f04c9dab3.poster.avif?t=1730438295\" width=320 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b9f9effc1c521661add1cc0f04c9dab3.webm?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833910/extras/b9f9effc1c521661add1cc0f04c9dab3.mp4?t=1730438295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
